Package: anovakun
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Variance for Factorial Designs ('ANOVA-kun')
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ryuta", "Iseki", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Koji", "Kosugi", email = "kosugitti@gmail.com", role = "cre",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5816-0099")))
Description: Performs analysis of variance for between-subjects,
    within-subjects, and mixed factorial designs, including post hoc
    analyses, sphericity tests and corrections, effect sizes, and their
    confidence intervals. This package wraps the 'ANOVA-kun' function by
    Ryuta Iseki without changing its computations; version 1.0.0 contains
    'ANOVA-kun' 4.8.9.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kosugitti/anovakun, https://kosugitti.github.io/anovakun/
BugReports: https://github.com/kosugitti/anovakun/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: lmerTest, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
